5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I am glad we are all here to discuss this important expansion for our library.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Thank you, Shizue. I am here to listen carefully. I hope we can find a path that truly serves everyone in our community.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to check if we are just guessing again! We should look at what actually happened before, not just what sounds nice.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Rin, you’re right to be skeptical. I’ll just note that ""sounds nice"" is often where budgets go to die. Let’s keep that in mind.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Rin. We need data, not vibes. Let’s pick two specific records to review before we commit to anything.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I worry about relying on conditions we cannot control. Let us look at winter road closures and former outreach attendance to see what actually held.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am inclined to examine the bus links in the outer wards and the evening room bookings. These seem to define who can actually reach us.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I’m picking the two programmes from six years ago and the volunteer register. I want to see what actually stuck and who is trained to run it!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I’ll check the county grant terms and last year’s running lines. I suspect the funding structure is the real trap here, not the size.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I’ll review the volunteer register and supervision training. I need to verify if the required skills actually exist on our current roster before we add more duties.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
